{
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.Attack.Description": "Fires her blunderbuss; empties the chamber."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.Attack.Name": "Blunderbuss Shot"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.BuggerOut.Description": "Drops a smoke grenade and runs when badly hurt."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.BuggerOut.Name": "Bugger Out"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.PushBack.Description": "Charges in and fires at contact range, throwing you both apart."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.PushBack.Name": "Point-Blank Shot"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.Reload.Description": "Reloads her blunderbuss, skipping her attack."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.Reload.Name": "Reload"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.SkeetShot.Description": "Throws a pink flask and tries to shoot it before it reaches you."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.SkeetShot.Name": "Skeet Shot"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.TakeAim.Description": "Marks a spot on you for six turns: better accuracy, crits and damage."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Ability.TakeAim.Name": "Take Aim"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.BuggerOut.GrabsSmokeGrenade": "[pg]She quickly grabs some type of grenade from one of her pouches. It's not pink like her other grenades, however, and you remain on guard, prepared to dodge it.\nShe briefly threatens to throw it at you, but smiles and stops at the last moment. [say: I'll get ya one day!] she says, before throwing the grenade on her feet."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.BuggerOut.PreparedSmoke": "[pg]She reaches for the smoke grenade again, but you're prepared for that this time! You do your best to face away from her and cover your ears just before the device detonates. You hear the bang, turn to face her again and notice something dashing away from the smoke cloud and out of sight. Time to get this slippery goblin!"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.BuggerOut.SmokeFlashBlind": "[pg]The grenade detonates with a bright flash, a deafening sound, and if that wasn't enough, a pitch black smoke cloud. You cough and rub your eyes, completely stunned by her device. Damn it, she's going to escape!"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.BuggerOut.StaggersCrikey": "The goblin staggers back, her body jiggling humorously as she struggles to stand. [say: Crikey, you're a tough nut, ain't ya? Rubbish, I ain't staying around for this!]"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Description": "Her appearance is that of a regular goblin, curvy and pale green, perhaps slightly taller than the norm. Her wavy, untamed hair is a fiery red, though you can't see much of it due to the comical cavalier hat she's wearing. Her soft curves are accentuated by her choice of wear, a single belt lined with assorted pouches strapped across her full chest and a pair of fishnet stockings reaching up to her thick thighs. She bounces on the spot, preparing to dodge anything you might have in store, though your eyes seem to wander towards her bare slit and jiggling ass. Despite her obvious knowledge in combat, she's a goblin all the same -- a hard cock can go a long way.[pg]<b>This goblin has an old blunderbuss in her hands!</b> "
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.HandleCombatLossText.SighBackToCamp": "[pg]You sigh in frustration and make your way back to your camp. You'll get her next time, or so you tell yourself."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Name": "goblin sharpshooter"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.PushBack.LaunchedBackwards": "[pg]You're launched several feet backwards, lifted off the ground by the massive directed explosion of her special shot. When you finally land, you notice to your relief that there was no projectile. You get up, and see that the goblin was also thrown back quite a few feet from the recoil; it seems you two are <b>distanced</b> now!\nShe gets back on her feet and adjusts her now-dirtied hat, still focused on you."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.PushBack.LoadsRedCartridge": "The goblin quickly takes a red paper cartridge from her pouch, rips it open with her mouth and loads her musket with it. To your surprise, instead of keeping her distance, she charges forward, intending on hitting you point blank! "
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.PushBack.MuzzleChestShot": " She catches you by surprise, moving too fast for you to avoid her attack. She places the flared muzzle against your chest and fires!"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Reload.ReloadsBlunderbuss": "The goblin takes some time to reload her blunderbuss. She does it with surprising dexterity, but not enough to prevent you from attacking her again."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.SkeetShot.FlaskDetonatesMidair": "\nShe fires and hits the flask in full, detonating it before it reaches you and covering you in a pink mist! Despite your best attempts, you accidentally breathe it in, feeling your body heat up with unwanted arousal. You look at the goblin again and she throws a kiss at you, flashing a mischievous smile afterwards. Giving up and fucking her until that smile vanishes seems like such a great idea now..."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.SkeetShot.GrenadeDetonatesEarly": "\nThe grenade detonates before you manage to get enough distance! Despite your best attempts, you accidentally breathe it in, feeling your body heat up with unwanted arousal. You look at the goblin again and she throws a kiss at you, flashing a mischievous smile afterwards. Giving up and fucking her until that smile vanishes seems like such a great idea now..."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.SkeetShot.ShotGoesWide": "\nShe fires, but thankfully the shot goes wide. The flask lands in front of you before the fuse is up, giving you some time to avoid its blast radius!"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.SkeetShot.ThrowsPinkFlask": "The goblin takes a pink glass flask from her pouch and throws it at you, giving it quite the arc. You ready yourself to dodge the object, but she takes aim and attempts to shoot it just as it reaches you, to prevent any evasion!"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.TakeAim.TakesAimBlunderbuss": "The goblin breathes deeply, carefully taking aim with her blunderbuss, locking onto you. [say: Gotta know where 'ta shoot to put 'em down,] she says, a smile creeping up on her face.\nYou're pretty sure she has <b>marked</b> a spot on your body, and will do a lot more damage now!"
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.TryToGrabGobbo.DashIntoSmoke": "You dash into the cloud as quickly as you can manage. The smoke is thick and almost pitch black, but you manage to discern her voluptuous silhouette. You stretch your arm and grab her by her thong, causing the already weakened goblin to yelp and stumble, falling face first onto the ground."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.TryToGrabGobbo.DefeatedGoblin": "[pg]You cross your arms. That's a defeated goblin if you've ever seen one."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.TryToGrabGobbo.DirtiedChampion": "[pg]When the smoke clears, there's nothing but a dirtied and annoyed Champion on the ground. You cringe in anger before getting up to your feet and cleaning yourself as best you can. That damn goblin."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.TryToGrabGobbo.GrabMisses": "You dash into the cloud as quickly as you can manage. You swing your arms wildly, attempting to grab the annoying fleeing goblin.\nDespite your efforts, however, she manages to outsmart you, getting behind you and lightly kicking your [butt]. You lose your balance and fall face first on the ground, prompting a solid laugh from the goblin as the flees."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.TryToGrabGobbo.GrabbedGoblin": "[pg]When the smoke clears, you see a trembling goblin clutching a silly cavalier hat while staring in horror at you."
  "Scenes.Goblinsharpshooter.Won.KickedUnconscious": "You collapse in front of the goblin, too wounded to fight. She growls and kicks you in the head, making your vision swim. As your sight fades, you hear her murmur, [say: Fucking dicks can't even bother to grow a dick or cunt.]"
}
